WEBVTT

00:33.580 --> 00:37.020
=Royal Upstart 2=
(Based on "Zhenguan Foolish Son-in-Law")

00:37.325 --> 00:39.837
=Episode 15=

00:39.885 --> 00:42.600
(We Won't Dare Again)

00:42.987 --> 00:45.439
(Ministry of Justice Prison)

00:45.439 --> 00:46.399
Gentlemen,

00:47.440 --> 00:49.879
do you know what
crimes you've committed?

00:51.880 --> 00:52.839
- Lord Wei.
- Lord Wei.

00:55.679 --> 00:57.880
Wasn't Wei Hao
arrested and thrown in jail?

00:57.880 --> 00:59.719
How can he still be so relaxed?

00:59.719 --> 01:00.480
Indeed.

01:00.679 --> 01:02.920
The jailers here
show him a lot of respect.

01:03.380 --> 01:05.519
Even those Ministry of Justice
officials do as well.

01:06.839 --> 01:07.800
Gentlemen,

01:09.280 --> 01:10.719
you'd better confess quickly.

01:10.960 --> 01:12.320
Stop wasting my time.

01:14.110 --> 01:15.359
I think you should just ask him,

01:15.359 --> 01:16.450
"How much money do you have?

01:16.600 --> 01:17.840
Where did the money come from?"

01:18.359 --> 01:19.159
Also,

01:19.600 --> 01:20.880
"Why did you frame me?

01:21.159 --> 01:22.640
What do you gain by framing me?"

01:23.079 --> 01:23.560
Ask them.

01:25.240 --> 01:26.560
Lord Wei, you must be joking.

01:26.759 --> 01:27.560
This...

01:27.590 --> 01:28.920
This is still under interrogation.

01:28.920 --> 01:29.719
I don't care.

01:30.760 --> 01:32.560
This one with
the shrewish look on his face,

01:32.560 --> 01:33.439
he's a corrupt official.

01:33.439 --> 01:34.439
Investigate him.

01:35.079 --> 01:36.479
Preposterous!

01:36.560 --> 01:37.479
You brat...

01:38.439 --> 01:39.200
You...

01:39.200 --> 01:39.920
Still looking?

01:40.079 --> 01:40.880
Still looking.

01:42.840 --> 01:43.600
Still looking?

01:43.600 --> 01:44.600
You're asking for a beating.

01:44.600 --> 01:45.439
Lord...

01:45.439 --> 01:46.320
Please calm down, Lord.

01:46.399 --> 01:47.680
Lord, you must not.

01:48.680 --> 01:50.300
You think I don't know you impeached me?

01:51.380 --> 01:52.920
You can say I'm colluding with Beicang,

01:52.920 --> 01:54.120
but I can't say a word to you?

01:55.040 --> 01:56.040
Just you wait.

01:56.239 --> 01:57.879
If you have the skill
to get out of here,

01:57.879 --> 01:59.439
I'll drag you right back in.

02:03.840 --> 02:04.640
Continue.

02:04.879 --> 02:05.680
Hao.

02:07.640 --> 02:08.439
Hao.

02:08.680 --> 02:09.480
Aunt?

02:09.500 --> 02:11.159
Why did you deliver
this personally again?

02:11.159 --> 02:12.079
Let the servants do it.

02:12.079 --> 02:12.560
It's exhausting.

02:12.560 --> 02:13.879
Is he really here to serve time

02:13.879 --> 02:15.200
or just for a visit?

02:15.319 --> 02:17.359
I must impeach those
Ministry of Justice officials.

02:17.719 --> 02:19.840
They have poor
management of the jailers.

02:20.000 --> 02:22.560
The jailers are actually
fawning over a prisoner?

02:23.000 --> 02:23.840
Mister Lu,

02:23.959 --> 02:25.200
just give it a rest.

02:25.200 --> 02:26.879
You are still in a cell right now.

02:26.879 --> 02:28.239
If you offend the jailers here,

02:28.239 --> 02:29.480
you'll have to suffer for it.

02:30.760 --> 02:32.680
Like I'd care about that!

02:35.159 --> 02:37.120
I had the kitchen
make many dishes today,

02:37.120 --> 02:38.359
all of your favorites.

02:38.799 --> 02:39.959
Why so happy today?

02:40.159 --> 02:40.920
Today,

02:40.920 --> 02:42.599
our mansion has a joyous event.

02:42.719 --> 02:43.560
What event?

02:44.159 --> 02:44.840
You

02:45.040 --> 02:46.519
have been titled a Marquis.

02:46.840 --> 02:47.640
Wait, what?

02:50.719 --> 02:51.759
This afternoon,

02:51.759 --> 02:53.159
you were titled a Marquis.

02:54.159 --> 02:55.120
What did I even do?

02:55.400 --> 02:57.280
I became a Marquis
just by sitting in jail?

02:57.879 --> 02:58.599
This...

02:58.599 --> 03:00.000
This is...

03:00.159 --> 03:00.960
A Marquis?

03:01.360 --> 03:02.360
A Marquis?

03:02.840 --> 03:03.360
Yes.

03:03.719 --> 03:04.360
Come.

03:04.479 --> 03:05.400
Take this.

03:05.479 --> 03:06.400
And these as well.

03:06.840 --> 03:09.520
Buy some things you like,
and share some with the brothers here.

03:09.520 --> 03:10.199
Young Madam,

03:10.199 --> 03:10.719
this...

03:10.719 --> 03:11.520
This won't do.

03:11.520 --> 03:12.520
This is no ordinary money.

03:12.520 --> 03:13.560
It's celebration money.

03:14.400 --> 03:16.000
Our mansion has a joyous event today.

03:16.639 --> 03:17.599
Hao

03:17.599 --> 03:18.919
is now a Marquis.

03:19.660 --> 03:21.879
- Congratulations, Marquis!
- Congratulations, Marquis!

03:22.639 --> 03:23.360
Thank you for

03:23.360 --> 03:25.639
looking after Hao in jail
these past few days.

03:25.639 --> 03:26.000
Let's go.

03:26.000 --> 03:26.719
Time to eat.

03:26.719 --> 03:28.639
How did I go from a Lord to a Marquis?

03:29.560 --> 03:31.680
This fool was titled a Marquis
while in jail?

03:32.000 --> 03:34.520
Our impeachment
actually resulted in a Marquis.

03:36.759 --> 03:37.639
It's fake!

03:37.759 --> 03:38.599
It's a lie!

03:38.919 --> 03:40.759
I must impeach Wei Hao.

03:41.159 --> 03:42.520
He forged an imperial edict!

03:42.680 --> 03:43.560
Just shut up.

03:44.080 --> 03:44.680
Send men

03:45.039 --> 03:46.000
to search his house.

03:54.319 --> 03:57.120
(In the future, Marquis Wei
will be quite a big deal.)

03:57.240 --> 03:58.039
What?

03:58.400 --> 03:59.800
Wei Hao was made a Marquis?

04:00.000 --> 04:01.800
This news came from
the Ministry of Justice Prison.

04:01.800 --> 04:02.759
How could it be false?

04:03.840 --> 04:04.639
I heard

04:04.759 --> 04:06.680
he's living a rather
comfortable life in prison.

04:07.599 --> 04:09.080
This whole thing is strange.

04:11.240 --> 04:12.400
Could it be

04:12.879 --> 04:15.039
that Wei Hao has someone backing him up?

04:22.280 --> 04:24.280
Wei Hao gave the shares
to the Imperial Family?

04:24.280 --> 04:25.560
I'm not sure about this either.

04:27.080 --> 04:28.080
Could it be

04:28.199 --> 04:29.840
that we pushed him too hard?

04:30.479 --> 04:33.360
Well, didn't we just do all the work
for someone else to benefit?

04:33.599 --> 04:35.400
We can't confirm this news yet.

04:36.360 --> 04:37.400
But I heard

04:37.960 --> 04:40.719
the glaze workshop is
currently managed by a woman.

04:41.520 --> 04:42.639
It's Wei Hao's aunt.

04:48.800 --> 04:50.560
Let's go to the workshop tomorrow.

04:50.759 --> 04:52.159
It's a good time to talk to them.

04:52.879 --> 04:54.080
We can also find out

04:54.479 --> 04:55.759
who this woman is.

04:56.479 --> 04:57.000
Fine.

04:57.650 --> 05:02.287
(Juzhen Glaze Workshop)

05:04.439 --> 05:05.240
Put it there.

05:05.439 --> 05:05.959
Great.

05:11.160 --> 05:11.759
Come over here.

05:12.000 --> 05:12.480
Alright.

05:16.519 --> 05:17.519
Pardon me for asking,

05:18.439 --> 05:20.160
but who was that woman who just went in?

05:20.399 --> 05:21.720
(Juzhen Glaze Workshop)
She's our boss as well.

05:21.879 --> 05:22.920
Your boss?

05:23.639 --> 05:24.480
What's her name?

05:24.480 --> 05:25.680
Which household is she from?

05:26.199 --> 05:28.240
I'm not quite sure about that.

05:28.240 --> 05:28.879
In any case,

05:28.879 --> 05:30.120
we all just call her "Boss".

05:31.519 --> 05:32.879
Please go and announce us.

05:33.160 --> 05:34.600
Say the Cui family seeks an audience.

05:36.279 --> 05:37.000
Well...

05:37.480 --> 05:38.920
Just go when you're told.

05:38.920 --> 05:40.199
She will see us.

05:40.199 --> 05:40.959
Fine.

05:40.959 --> 05:42.360
Then, please wait a moment.

05:42.360 --> 05:43.319
I'll go and ask.

06:00.199 --> 06:02.680
Your Highness, the Cui family is outside
seeking an audience.

06:03.560 --> 06:04.759
The Cui family?

06:05.439 --> 06:08.079
Seeking me out now,
so they realized something?

06:08.079 --> 06:09.920
Your Highness, should you see them?

06:11.600 --> 06:12.160
Yes.

06:13.079 --> 06:15.079
It's time they found out

06:15.110 --> 06:16.959
they've provoked someone
they shouldn't have.

06:17.399 --> 06:19.000
For making Wei Hao go to prison,

06:19.199 --> 06:20.160
this is a debt

06:20.399 --> 06:22.439
I'm going to settle with them properly.

06:22.450 --> 06:23.190
Yes, Your Highness.

06:31.920 --> 06:32.720
Body search.

06:32.720 --> 06:33.480
What?

06:33.500 --> 06:34.560
We have to be searched too?

06:34.959 --> 06:36.120
To see Her Highness,

06:36.519 --> 06:37.399
this is the rule.

06:37.600 --> 06:38.399
What?

06:38.600 --> 06:39.399
Her Highness?

06:40.130 --> 06:42.590
(Has this place really been
taken over by the Imperial Family?)

06:44.160 --> 06:46.199
(I wonder which princess it is.)

06:46.519 --> 06:47.319
Go on in.

06:48.687 --> 06:51.925
(Juzhen Glaze Workshop)

06:58.620 --> 07:00.839
- Greetings, Your Highness.
- Greetings, Your Highness.

07:01.560 --> 07:03.000
Why have you come to see me?

07:03.600 --> 07:04.879
Just to discuss

07:05.439 --> 07:07.240
the matter of the fifth kiln's glaze.

07:07.879 --> 07:09.240
The fifth kiln's glaze?

07:10.000 --> 07:11.000
Discuss?

07:12.399 --> 07:14.040
Who agreed to discuss this with you?

07:14.800 --> 07:15.600
This

07:15.680 --> 07:16.720
was promised by Wei Hao.

07:20.120 --> 07:21.000
Wei Hao?

07:22.800 --> 07:25.040
Wei Hao has no authority
to promise such a thing.

07:25.680 --> 07:26.480
Currently,

07:26.720 --> 07:29.040
this glaze workshop
belongs to the Imperial Family.

07:29.519 --> 07:30.879
Even from the beginning,

07:31.279 --> 07:33.319
the Imperial Family held
a fifty-percent share.

07:34.240 --> 07:35.920
Even if Wei Hao promised you,

07:36.160 --> 07:38.319
it still requires my consent.

07:38.399 --> 07:39.120
What?

07:43.160 --> 07:43.680
This...

07:44.600 --> 07:45.399
Your Highness.

07:52.000 --> 07:54.680
(How come it's the most powerful
Eldest Princess of the Great Yong?)

07:54.920 --> 07:56.199
Didn't you hear me?

07:57.199 --> 07:58.200
Regarding this matter,

07:58.360 --> 07:59.920
Wei Hao's consent is useless.

08:00.319 --> 08:02.480
You need my permission as well.

08:03.160 --> 08:04.920
Now that Wei Hao is in prison,

08:05.439 --> 08:08.199
production at the glaze workshop
has been severely affected.

08:09.600 --> 08:11.839
I heard you were the ones
who impeached him.

08:13.160 --> 08:14.000
Well...

08:15.879 --> 08:17.040
Your impeachment

08:17.199 --> 08:18.879
has caused me significant losses.

08:19.079 --> 08:21.279
And now you still want
to get goods from me?

08:21.800 --> 08:23.560
Do you really think I'm a pushover?

08:24.920 --> 08:26.480
Please calm your anger, Your Highness.

08:26.879 --> 08:27.800
Regarding this matter,

08:28.160 --> 08:30.199
we didn't know the Imperial Family
held a share.

08:30.439 --> 08:31.199
Had we known,

08:31.210 --> 08:32.680
we never would have dared to do this.

08:34.399 --> 08:36.040
So, are you saying

08:36.199 --> 08:38.160
that if the Imperial Family
didn't have a share,

08:38.399 --> 08:40.920
you would have troubled Wei Hao?

08:41.879 --> 08:43.480
When it comes to bullying commoners,

08:43.680 --> 08:45.560
you people certainly are experts, huh?

08:52.560 --> 08:53.240
That's enough.

08:53.920 --> 08:55.720
If there's nothing else, leave.

08:56.360 --> 08:58.839
It's impossible for me
to give you any glaze pieces.

08:59.000 --> 08:59.720
After all,

09:00.160 --> 09:01.680
Wei Hao is still in prison.

09:01.680 --> 09:02.279
Leave.

09:03.480 --> 09:04.560
But...

09:05.079 --> 09:06.350
Your Highness, please calm down.

09:06.480 --> 09:08.319
Please give us another chance.

09:08.519 --> 09:10.079
We still have many orders to fulfill.

09:10.090 --> 09:11.199
If we can't provide the glaze...

09:11.199 --> 09:11.680
Get out.

09:11.680 --> 09:12.079
We...

09:33.080 --> 09:34.100
Come on, take it slow.

09:37.250 --> 09:37.837
(Juzhen Glaze Workshop)

09:37.879 --> 09:38.480
This way.

09:40.279 --> 09:41.879
Who could've thought this glaze workshop

09:41.879 --> 09:43.800
actually had the Imperial Family
as shareholders?

09:44.159 --> 09:45.919
Why didn't Wei Hao say so earlier?

09:46.310 --> 09:48.120
Would there be this much trouble
if he had?

09:49.399 --> 09:50.480
Wei Hao

09:51.200 --> 09:52.919
is practically playing us for fools.

09:53.159 --> 09:54.900
We must think of
a countermeasure quickly.

09:54.919 --> 09:56.360
Otherwise, our clans' reputations

09:56.679 --> 09:58.600
will be severely damaged.

09:58.799 --> 09:59.580
When the time comes,

10:00.000 --> 10:01.559
if other merchants bring goods

10:01.559 --> 10:02.960
to our territory to sell,

10:02.960 --> 10:03.759
won't that

10:03.840 --> 10:05.799
be a huge slap in our clans' faces?

10:05.799 --> 10:07.200
We must find a solution.

10:08.559 --> 10:10.200
Let's go to the Wei Clan Leader first,

10:11.200 --> 10:12.120
then go find Wei Hao.

10:13.039 --> 10:14.080
The top priority

10:14.519 --> 10:16.360
is to get the goods in our hands first.

10:16.360 --> 10:17.990
Wei Hao is backed
by the Imperial Family.

10:18.039 --> 10:18.840
We have no choice

10:19.159 --> 10:20.639
but to back down now.

10:21.840 --> 10:22.639
Let's back down.

10:23.559 --> 10:24.399
Let's go.

10:27.912 --> 10:29.937
(Baozheng Hall)

10:29.960 --> 10:30.759
Clan Leader,

10:30.919 --> 10:33.799
the representatives from the great clans
in the capital are here again.

10:35.320 --> 10:37.279
What are they here for this time?

10:38.399 --> 10:41.440
How long do they intend
to keep pressuring our Wei clan?

10:41.440 --> 10:44.399
Do they really think the Wei clan
is easy to bully?

10:48.600 --> 10:49.399
Clan Leader Wei,

10:50.559 --> 10:51.480
it's a misunderstanding.

10:52.000 --> 10:55.720
What brings you all to
the Wei Mansion again?

10:56.200 --> 10:57.390
Regarding Wei Hao's situation,

10:57.519 --> 10:58.960
go talk to Wei Hao himself.

10:59.200 --> 11:01.720
As for the profit-sharing
of the glaze workshop,

11:01.759 --> 11:04.200
I have no say in that.

11:04.720 --> 11:06.240
You're joking, Clan Leader Wei.

11:13.080 --> 11:15.039
I wonder if you are aware, Clan Leader,

11:15.519 --> 11:17.559
that Wei Hao's glaze workshop

11:18.120 --> 11:19.600
has an imperial share?

11:19.759 --> 11:20.559
What?

11:21.200 --> 11:22.600
An imperial share?

11:24.879 --> 11:26.000
How is that possible?

11:26.639 --> 11:29.639
When did Wei Hao get to know
people from the Imperial Family?

11:29.960 --> 11:31.960
If he didn't know them,

11:33.519 --> 11:35.100
how could he be conferred as a Marquis

11:35.200 --> 11:36.320
while sitting in prison?

11:37.159 --> 11:38.240
Conferred as a Marquis?

11:38.840 --> 11:40.720
Wei Hao was made a Marquis?

11:42.480 --> 11:43.120
Yes.

11:43.310 --> 11:44.639
Congratulations, Clan Leader Wei.

11:44.639 --> 11:46.519
Your clan now has a Marquis.

11:46.519 --> 11:48.759
- Congratulations.
- Congratulations.

11:49.039 --> 11:51.679
It is indeed worth celebrating.

11:56.360 --> 11:57.799
What a joyful occasion!

12:00.200 --> 12:01.320
The Wei clan

12:01.519 --> 12:04.039
has finally produced a Marquis!

12:05.279 --> 12:06.720
Congratulations, Clan Leader.

12:07.799 --> 12:09.440
Congratulations, Clan Leader Wei.

12:12.360 --> 12:13.879
Could we trouble you, Clan Leader,

12:14.039 --> 12:15.799
to go to the prison
and speak with Wei Hao?

12:16.120 --> 12:17.610
Let's just put this matter behind us.

12:19.639 --> 12:20.159
Of course,

12:20.590 --> 12:22.159
as for making amends and apologizing,

12:22.159 --> 12:23.720
we will certainly fulfill our part.

12:23.960 --> 12:24.799
Rest assured,

12:25.360 --> 12:27.279
we will have
the officials from our clans

12:27.559 --> 12:30.000
immediately cease the impeachment
against Wei Hao.

12:37.080 --> 12:38.480
Speaking of impeachment,

12:38.879 --> 12:39.799
this time,

12:40.200 --> 12:42.320
it's really a great misunderstanding.

12:44.799 --> 12:46.519
You impeached Wei Hao

12:46.519 --> 12:48.919
for selling glaze to Hu merchants,

12:49.120 --> 12:50.080
but in fact,

12:50.399 --> 12:52.600
it was authorized by
the Imperial Family.

12:52.799 --> 12:53.960
In other words,

12:54.639 --> 12:57.480
you were criticizing
the Imperial Family,

12:57.759 --> 12:58.720
and even

12:59.360 --> 13:02.519
criticizing His Majesty himself.

13:03.399 --> 13:05.919
No wonder so many
officials were arrested.

13:06.759 --> 13:11.639
I only just figured it out myself.

13:11.799 --> 13:13.799
(So that's where the problem lies.)

13:13.960 --> 13:15.399
(By impeaching Wei Hao,)

13:15.799 --> 13:17.679
(aren't we just impeaching the Emperor?)

13:20.240 --> 13:20.960
(Harmony and Prosperity)
Clan Leader Wei,

13:20.960 --> 13:23.879
what is the most urgent
thing we should do now?

13:24.919 --> 13:26.919
I don't mean to lecture you,

13:27.720 --> 13:28.679
but before,

13:28.919 --> 13:31.000
you all went way too far.

13:31.279 --> 13:32.960
You were far too arrogant.

13:36.912 --> 13:39.237
(Ganlu Palace)

13:40.440 --> 13:43.039
And now they're saying Wei
Hao was wrongly accused.

13:43.480 --> 13:44.240
It seems

13:44.720 --> 13:46.000
they also realize

13:46.279 --> 13:48.519
I'm using Wei Hao to deal with them.

13:49.919 --> 13:50.799
Actually,

13:51.000 --> 13:54.519
I planned to let Wei Hao
out tomorrow anyway.

13:54.799 --> 13:55.840
Pass on my oral decree.

13:56.600 --> 13:57.679
At dawn tomorrow,

13:57.960 --> 13:59.320
let Wei Hao go home.

13:59.360 --> 14:00.240
Yes, Your Majesty.

14:02.600 --> 14:04.200
(This fool is in and out)

14:04.399 --> 14:06.039
(of prison just like that?)

14:06.039 --> 14:07.225
(Ministry of Justice Prison)

14:26.759 --> 14:27.320
Holy cow!

14:29.519 --> 14:30.039
You...

14:31.960 --> 14:33.080
You've been locked up too?

14:33.279 --> 14:34.279
What did you do?

14:35.679 --> 14:37.320
I knew you were up to no good.

14:37.320 --> 14:38.480
I knew you'd end up here eventually.

14:38.480 --> 14:39.000
Get lost.

14:39.800 --> 14:41.120
Do I look like a prisoner to you?

14:41.130 --> 14:43.080
Say something nice
for once this morning, please.

14:43.279 --> 14:44.279
No?

14:45.800 --> 14:46.919
So, you're here to visit me?

14:48.679 --> 14:49.639
By the imperial decree,

14:49.879 --> 14:50.840
you're free to go.

14:52.000 --> 14:53.799
His Majesty's decree says
you can go home now.

14:53.800 --> 14:54.919
What are you standing there for?

14:54.919 --> 14:55.720
Pack your things and move.

14:55.720 --> 14:56.679
Let's go.

14:56.679 --> 14:57.159
Go.

14:57.320 --> 14:57.799
Go.

14:58.080 --> 14:58.440
Go.

14:59.919 --> 15:01.279
You don't want this stuff anymore?

15:02.600 --> 15:03.240
I do.

15:03.840 --> 15:05.000
This is my room.

15:05.700 --> 15:07.200
No one else can use it while I'm gone.

15:07.919 --> 15:09.360
Help me tidy these things up

15:09.360 --> 15:10.159
and put them away.

15:10.159 --> 15:11.120
I'll need them next time.

15:11.759 --> 15:12.639
But, Marquis,

15:13.000 --> 15:14.440
please don't come back next time.

15:14.759 --> 15:16.559
This really isn't a good place to be.

15:19.759 --> 15:20.799
Sometimes,

15:22.639 --> 15:24.559
you just can't help it.

15:24.720 --> 15:26.080
Aren't I forced into it?

15:29.110 --> 15:30.080
(With that mouth of yours,)

15:30.080 --> 15:31.759
(what trouble haven't you caused?)

15:34.480 --> 15:35.000
(No way.)

15:35.679 --> 15:37.120
(When Wei the Fool throws a tantrum,)

15:37.200 --> 15:38.759
(I can't take him on alone.)

15:40.175 --> 15:43.225
(Ministry of Justice Prison)

15:47.200 --> 15:48.039
Go on home now.

15:48.440 --> 15:49.360
It's about to snow.

15:49.360 --> 15:50.490
It'll probably start tonight.

15:50.720 --> 15:51.559
Look at the sky.

15:53.000 --> 15:54.440
I think it'll start any minute.

15:54.450 --> 15:55.080
What about you?

15:55.080 --> 15:55.940
Aren't you going back?

15:55.960 --> 15:57.080
I'm still on duty.

15:57.440 --> 15:58.720
You think I'm like you?

15:58.919 --> 15:59.519
You...

16:12.279 --> 16:13.279
Greetings, Father.

16:14.519 --> 16:15.360
Greetings, Uncle,

16:15.440 --> 16:16.279
Chong.

16:17.610 --> 16:19.800
- Greetings, Your Highness.
- Greetings, Your Highness.

16:20.200 --> 16:21.039
Sit down and talk.

16:22.960 --> 16:26.279
Your uncle and Chong
came specifically to see you today.

16:27.480 --> 16:30.000
Ning'an, you're a grown-up now.

16:30.000 --> 16:31.720
You have become quite elegant.

16:32.240 --> 16:35.039
It's time your marriage
was put on the agenda.

16:39.679 --> 16:41.000
Thank you for your concern, Uncle,

16:41.240 --> 16:43.360
but there's no rush for this matter.

16:46.799 --> 16:47.600
Your Majesty,

16:48.360 --> 16:49.720
Chong and Ning'an

16:49.960 --> 16:51.600
grew up together.

16:51.919 --> 16:52.679
Now,

16:52.679 --> 16:54.240
they are a perfect match,

16:54.240 --> 16:56.080
a gifted couple.

16:57.480 --> 16:59.080
I am so bold as to

16:59.320 --> 17:03.120
request Your Majesty
grant them a marriage soon.

17:12.087 --> 17:14.917
♪Everyone says I'm a big silly fool♪

17:15.537 --> 17:18.937
♪When things happen,
I only know how to count on my fingers♪

17:19.707 --> 17:22.657
♪They shake their heads
and say I'm pitiful♪

17:22.997 --> 17:25.697
♪Sigh and walk away♪

17:27.297 --> 17:30.767
♪Little do they know,
I am sharp and bright♪

17:30.767 --> 17:32.997
♪With a heart like a mirror,
I understand the world's♪

17:32.997 --> 17:35.107
♪Colors and darkness♪

17:35.107 --> 17:37.127
♪But I keep my edge hidden♪

17:37.127 --> 17:41.487
♪The day I become famous
is just around the corner♪

17:42.927 --> 17:46.657
♪In the hotpot restaurant,
skewers boil in the broth♪

17:46.927 --> 17:50.527
♪People come and go,
with few worries or troubles♪

17:50.687 --> 17:52.767
♪The clacking of the abacus rings out♪

17:52.767 --> 17:57.557
♪See me differently.
Who dares to challenge me?♪

17:57.777 --> 17:59.397
♪The world mistakes me♪

17:59.397 --> 18:01.737
♪For an ignorant and stubborn fool♪

18:01.807 --> 18:02.997
♪As the storm approaches♪

18:02.997 --> 18:05.397
♪I just shrug and watch with a smile♪

18:05.607 --> 18:07.327
♪This foolish image is convenient♪

18:07.327 --> 18:09.307
♪I use it as a protective shield♪

18:09.477 --> 18:11.227
♪Navigating with ease, I attract♪

18:11.227 --> 18:13.327
♪A lucky star to accompany me♪

18:13.327 --> 18:14.797
♪In a peaceful golden age♪

18:14.797 --> 18:17.027
♪I hold my lady's hand
to watch the world♪

18:17.247 --> 18:18.447
♪Pouring youth and fireworks♪

18:18.447 --> 18:20.967
♪Into a precious glazed cup♪

18:21.097 --> 18:22.807
♪Having experienced life's changes♪

18:22.807 --> 18:24.087
♪And tasted its highs and lows♪

18:24.237 --> 18:25.657
♪My wish has finally come true♪

18:25.657 --> 18:26.697
♪To stay by your side♪

18:26.697 --> 18:28.617
♪In this fleeting world♪

18:28.787 --> 18:32.037
♪We are free and happy♪

18:36.037 --> 18:37.817
♪From a nobody♪

18:37.817 --> 18:39.717
♪To someone now famous♪

18:39.827 --> 18:41.257
♪Ordinary people laugh at me♪

18:41.257 --> 18:43.767
♪But I laugh at how
they cannot see through it all♪

18:43.867 --> 18:45.447
♪Let others plot and scheme♪

18:45.447 --> 18:47.517
♪I will keep my heart unchanged♪

18:47.727 --> 18:49.407
♪In this vast world♪

18:49.407 --> 18:51.407
♪I find my own leisurely freedom♪

18:51.557 --> 18:53.767
♪The world is bustling,
and things constantly change♪

18:53.767 --> 18:55.357
♪Everything ends eventually♪

18:55.447 --> 18:56.947
♪All that remains before my eyes♪

18:56.947 --> 18:59.347
♪Is this street wandering,
still tinged with pity♪

18:59.347 --> 19:01.057
♪No matter how time flies♪

19:01.057 --> 19:02.217
♪Even if the falling snow♪

19:02.217 --> 19:03.847
♪Dyes the hair at our temples white♪

19:03.847 --> 19:04.887
♪All I want now♪

19:04.887 --> 19:06.987
♪Is to pray for
my lady's peace and safety♪

19:06.987 --> 19:10.247
♪Year after year♪
